Hi everyone,

In order to improve the package FIELDimageR, from version 0.1.7 we will change the name of some functions:

Old name

New name
> polygonShape()
> fieldPolygon()
> indices()
> fieldIndex()
> getInfo()
> fieldInfo()

This way is better to understand the FIELDimageR pipeline.

Please, let us know if you have any questions and remember to change your scripts.

Cheers,

Filipe Matias

